4.2.7-1
--------
- Package the Go DDNSTO 4.2.7 client for ARM and amd64, DSM 6 and DSM 7.
- Parameterize input/output paths; reject missing binaries and mismatched architectures/hashes.
- Build SPKs in isolated staging directories and emit SHA256 checksums and source manifests.
- Keep package configuration and boot state in persistent private storage.
- Use DSM-managed desktop integration and PID-scoped process supervision.
- Correct numeric device-index loading in the client (nonzero legacy indices require migration testing).
- Linux build validation completed; DSM device qualification is still required.
